                        "Details" : "Sumire tilts her head, \"Is that a Gladiator?\"\r\n\r\nYang laughs, \"It sure is! Now, this is what the Gladiator was truly meant to be! Another refurbished XL engine and enough ordnance to give an Archer pause. It has CASE in its right torso as well as a top grade Rangefinder while retaining all its jump jets.\"\r\n\r\nSmiling Darius adds, \"Awesome, a 55 tonner. That means the last one is likely an 80 tonne Assault!\"\r\n\r\nClearing her throat, Dr. Murad jumps in, \"We have the last set of coordinates, Commander. Our last stop is <b>Espia</b>.\"\r\n\r\nSumire nods.\r\n\r\nYang blurts out, \"Let's end this hunt and get that Assault mech before someone else does!\"\r\n\r\nYou clap your hands, \"Agreed. Let's rush over to <b>Espia</b> and call it a day.\"",
